        <mxCell id="other-tenant" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;OPTIONAL DIFFERENT ENTRA TENANT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Foundry account + backend-tenant application credentials&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Staged credential path; manual MI helper refuses cross-tenant&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;APIM-only credential custody / rotation • never client-distributed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Cross-tenant PE approval is independent of authentication&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Not the Resolver API app; not the managed-identity baseline&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8ed;strokeColor=#ca5010;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1810" y="1680" width="615" height="255" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="telemetry" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;AZURE MONITOR • core subscription / managed resources&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;⑥ APIM GatewayLogs + GatewayLlmLogs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;+ sanitized trusted usage / resolver traces&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Resolver + sync App Insights; Function logs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;→ Log Analytics → full chargeback workbook + fixed rate card&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Request-time person / group / project / model / family / backend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Disjoint input / output / cache read / write 5m / write 1h&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Stream cache categories unknown, never guessed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;No prompts / responses / credentials logged&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Selectors are NOT authorization; list price ≠ invoice&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3eefb;strokeColor=#8764b8;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="tenant">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1360" y="1115" width="615" height="355" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="dns" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;PRIVATE DNS + CUSTOMER NETWORK RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Baseline: privatelink.documents.azure.com • privatelink.blob.core.windows.net&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Optional inbound resolver: privatelink.azurewebsites.net&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Optional Foundry: privatelink.cognitiveservices.azure.com / openai.azure.com / services.ai.azure.com&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Link / forward from the ACTUAL APIM and Functions caller networks; hub peering does not share DNS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Customer owns approved custom DNS, firewall, UDR, hub / peering and ingress controls&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f9fc;strokeColor=#0078d4;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="1680" width="1730" height="195" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="revocation" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;REVOCATION / RECLASSIFICATION • bounded, not instantaneous&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;⑦ Group removal → successful sync → resolver / cache refresh → subsequent requests denied&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Baseline allow TTL 120s; refusal 30s; extra last-known-good grace 3600s on resolver failure&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Urgent: verify registry revoke, then deploy policy keyVersion • no eager generation eviction&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Move A → B: remove A / prove deny / add B; dual classifications never silently upgrade&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;New spend stamps B; historical spend remains with A, never rewritten from today&amp;#x27;s directory&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eaf5ea;strokeColor=#107c10;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="1905" width="1730" height="195" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;line-height:32px&quot;&gt;READING THIS OVERVIEW&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;BLUE solid arrows ①–④: synchronous auth / request dependency; response returns on the same request path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;GREEN dashed arrows ⑤ / ⑦: asynchronous membership projection / revocation   •   PURPLE dotted ⑥: telemetry / reporting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;ORANGE dashed: administrator control plane or optional credential / monetary path   •   GRAY dotted, no arrow: network association&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Solid blue/green service boxes: integrated implementation baseline (not live acceptance); amber dashed: optional production wiring / monetary or cross-tenant path&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Boundaries: dashed labeled tenant / subscription / VNet / subnet containers; cloud-managed PaaS runs OUTSIDE VNet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;line-height:27px&quot;&gt;Source baseline: ADR-0026 / ADR-0028; manual + quickstart modules, gateway policy, CLIENTS / SYNC / CHARGEBACK (see ARCHITECTURE.md)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#687787;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#101820;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
